# Destination Atlas — proof-react (Vite)
#
# Copy to `.env.local` in this directory (`apps/proof-react/.env.local`).
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser bundle.
#
# Alternative: use Settings → Integration keys (BYOK) in the running app —
# keys stay encrypted in the browser and override these fallbacks when set.
#
# Full catalog (AI, builder, database): see repo root `.env.example`

# --- Geo / maps ---
# Required for Map provider = google-maps
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional MapLibre vector tiles (MapTiler). Without this, demo MapLibre tiles are used.
# VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY=

# --- Intel / news ---
# Enables live NewsAPI fetch attempt on Intel (may need a server proxy for production CORS)
# VITE_NEWS_API_KEY=
